  "title": "One Edit Distance",
  "summary": "Determine if two strings, s and t, are one edit distance apart by verifying whether you can transform s into t through exactly one of the following operations: inserting a character, deleting a character, or replacing a character.",
  "statement": "Determine if two strings, s and t, are one edit distance apart by verifying whether you can transform s into t through exactly one of the following operations: inserting a character, deleting a character, or replacing a character.",
